  "description": "A flexible, thread-safe expression parser and evaluator for mathematical,\n      logical, string, array, and date/time expressions. Supports variables,\n      built-in functions, arrow functions, dot-operator property access, and\n      configurable evaluation limits. Also exports a machine-readable catalog of\n      the whole language — every function signature, parameter, example and\n      operator — for building editor tooling.",
